#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""KimScanning v2 — terminal scanner and local posture mirror.

Two modes:

* artifact scans (`repo`, `file`, `installer`, `web`, `server`) run the
  KimRity Security Gate and explain its findings from a static dictionary;
* `posture` inspects the running host itself (auditd, the KimAI pipeline,
  listeners, sshd, accounts, sysctl) and compares the result with a saved
  baseline, so drift is visible without any AI and without root.

Neither mode makes security decisions on its own: the gate owns artifact
verdicts, and posture reports facts plus a fix.
"""

